Make the Guix desktop build offline while retaining the built-in guide.

Updates.service being null is the existing disabled-updates path.  The
GitHub implementation is still compiled, but the desktop launcher no longer
registers it.  The twelve guide articles contain local data, not news fetched
from the network, so do not gate them on network connectivity.

Also treat an empty XDG_DATA_HOME like an unset one, as required by XDG.

